    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9734" root="حيس" body-key="H">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاسَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَحِيسُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيْسٌ</span>, <i>He mixed</i>
[a thing or things]. (S, A, K; but in this sense,
only the inf. n. is mentioned.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He made,</i> or
<i>prepared,</i> what is called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيْس</span>: (S, Msb, K:)

and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حيّس</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحْيِيسٌ</span>, <i>he mixed and prepared</i> what is so called. (TA.)

